      "content": "that sounds good in theory but feels a bit optimistic. if you look at the big players in tech right now, they're already moving way faster than any law can be written. it feels like the \"policy\" side is just a way to try and control something that's already out of the bag. don't you think the most realistic view is that technological progress is the primary driver and everything else is just a side effect?",
